"Import document images from Photos or Files" = "從照片或檔案匯入文件圖片";
"Import from Photos or Files" = "從照片或檔案匯入";
"Open the App Store, select your account, choose Redeem Gift Card or Code, then return to Mo Layer and tap Restore Purchases." = "開啟 App Store，選擇你的帳號，點選「兌換禮品卡或代碼」。完成兌換後返回 Mo Layer，點選「回復購買」。";
"Mo Layer requests permissions only when needed. Review or change this app’s permissions in System Settings." = "Mo Layer 僅在功能需要時要求權限。你可以在系統設定中查看或更改此 App 的權限。";
"Default follows your device language and region. Choose a language here to override it inside the app." = "預設跟隨你的 裝置 語言與地區。也可以在這裡為 App 單獨選擇語言。";
"You can delete vault items, manage permissions in System Settings, and choose whether to use iCloud features." = "你可以删除保险箱项目、在 裝置 设置中管理权限，并自行选择是否使用 iCloud 功能。";
"Set up device authentication in System Settings. The app only receives a yes or no result from the system." = "在系統設定中設定裝置認證。App 僅接收系統傳回的認證成功或失敗結果。";
"Open System Settings, sign in to iCloud, and allow this app to use iCloud. Your data remains encrypted locally until iCloud is available." = "開啟系統設定，登入 iCloud，並允許此 App 使用 iCloud。在 iCloud 可用前，你的資料會保持本機加密。";
"Adult-content warnings are controlled by the system, not by this app." = "成人內容警告由系統控制，而非此 App。";
"Sensitive Content Warning is managed by the system. Mo Layer cannot turn it off for you." = "敏感內容警告由系統管理。Mo Layer 無法替你關閉此功能。";
"Where available, manage Sensitive Content Warning in System Settings > Privacy & Security." = "如果系統支援，請在系統設定 > 隱私權與安全性中管理敏感內容警告。";

// Purchase restoration after reinstall
"Already purchased Pro?" = "已經購買過 Pro？";
"If you reinstalled Mo Layer or changed devices, restore purchases with the Apple Account used for your original purchase. You do not need to buy lifetime Pro again." = "重新安裝墨層或更換裝置後，請使用原購買時的 Apple 帳號恢復購買。永久會員無需重複購買。";

/* Storage capacity and membership */
"Your free 5 GB is full, or this file exceeds the remaining space. Open Pro to keep adding. Existing files stay available." = "免費 5 GB 空間已滿，或此檔案超過剩餘空間。開通 Pro 可繼續新增，已有檔案仍可使用。";
"Free includes 5 GB, unlimited file count, automatic backup, and restore. Pro removes the 5 GB app limit." = "免費享有 5 GB，不限檔案數量，支援自動備份與還原。Pro 可解除 App 的 5 GB 容量限制。";
"Choose your Pro plan" = "選擇適合你的 Pro";
"Membership plans are currently unavailable. You can keep using your free storage." = "暫時無法載入會員方案，你仍可繼續使用免費空間。";
"Your library" = "已用檔案容量";
"Free · 5 GB" = "免費版 · 5 GB";
"Counts files in every folder, including cloud-only files. No file count limit." = "統計所有目錄中的檔案，包含僅儲存在雲端的檔案。不限制檔案數量。";
"Every folder, ready to use" = "所有目錄，直接使用";
"Default folders and automatic encrypted backup are included for everyone." = "所有使用者均可使用預設目錄與自動加密備份。";
"Your files come back with you" = "換裝置，檔案也能找回來";
"Reinstall or change devices using the same iCloud account. Existing backups remain available after Pro ends." = "重裝或換裝置後，使用同一 iCloud 帳號還原。Pro 到期後，已有備份仍可查看和還原。";
"More room with Pro" = "Pro，讓容量不再受限";
"Free includes 5 GB. Pro removes the app limit; backups still use your own iCloud storage." = "免費版提供 5 GB 額度。Pro 解除 App 容量限制；備份仍使用你自己的 iCloud 空間。";
"%@ once. No subscription renewal." = "一次性支付 %@，無需續訂。";
"3 days free, then %@ / %@. Renews automatically unless canceled in Apple subscription settings." = "免費試用 3 天，之後 %@／%@。除非在 Apple 訂閱設定中取消，否則將自動續訂。";
"%@ / %@. Renews automatically unless canceled in Apple subscription settings. Trial eligibility is confirmed by Apple." = "%@／%@。除非在 Apple 訂閱設定中取消，否則將自動續訂。試用資格由 Apple 確認。";
"Room for what matters." = "珍貴的，都有空間。";
"Start with 5 GB free. Keep every memory within reach." = "從免費 5 GB 開始，讓每一份珍藏隨時可見。";
